INVESTIGATIVE SUMMARY & ENTITY RECORD
On March 02, 2026, Julian Thorne was interviewed in the presence of defense counsel Arthur Pendelton, Esq. Thorne agreed to provide proffer testimony detailing the cryptocurrency laundering mechanics executed on behalf of the syndicate.
Entity Declarations & Cross-References:
Financial Target: Julian Thorne (DOB: 03/22/1984, Alias: "Quant-JT")
OTC Crypto Desk: TetherBridge Global Capital (Virtual Office: Zug, Switzerland)
Primary Crypto Wallet (USDT-TRC20): TX9rP1mN8qZ4kLw2vY7sB3c5x1Q8mR0A9e
Receiving Crypto Wallet (BTC): bc1qxy2kgdygjrsqtzq2n0yrf2493p83kkfjhx0wlh
Real Estate Front: Solstice Properties Group LLC (Miami, FL, State ID: L2200049182)
Narrative Details:
Thorne corroborated CHS-4819's identification of Victor Vance as the primary decision-maker. Thorne explained that cash generated from domestic sales was converted into cryptocurrency using an Over-the-Counter (OTC) broker operating under the name TetherBridge Global Capital.
Thorne utilized encrypted communication channels (Telegram Handle: @Quant_JT_Ops) to schedule cash drops at a commercial warehouse located at 881 Metropolitan Ave, Brooklyn, NY. Cash amounts ranging from $250,000 to $500,000 per delivery were handed to a courier known only as "Gaston" (Described as male, Hispanic, late 30s, 6'1", tattoo of a dragon on the right forearm).
Upon physical delivery of cash, TetherBridge Global Capital initiated transfers of USDT to primary wallet TX9rP1mN8qZ4kLw2vY7sB3c5x1Q8mR0A9e. Thorne then executed a multi-chain split across four secondary unhosted wallets:
TX1_SubWallet_Alpha -> 25% allocation to bc1qxy2kgdygjrsqtzq2n0yrf2493p83kkfjhx0wlh (Converted to BTC)
TX2_SubWallet_Beta -> 35% allocation to Ethereum Smart Contract 0x71C7656EC7ab88b098defB751B7401B5f6d8976F
TX3_SubWallet_Gamma -> 20% transferred directly to Solstice Properties Group LLC bank account at SunState Bank (Account: 8840-1928-33) for luxury real estate acquisition in Sunny Isles, FL.
TX4_SubWallet_Delta -> 20% retained as operational buffer for fuel, driver pay, and legal retainers.
Thorne confirmed that Solstice Properties Group LLC is controlled by Mateo "El Bravo" Silva, an associate operating out of Miami, FL.
